{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927780/extras/UntitledProject2-ezgif.com-optimize__1_.gif?t=1753263839\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build your outpost in a world overrun by zombies. Defend it not just from the walkers but also from other survivors!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927780/extras/gameplay1.gif?t=1753263839\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your vehicle and loadout before embarking on your adventure. Use your abilities and control your units to eliminate all threats. Will you manage to defend your outpost? Upgrade your towers, walls, units or your vehicle. Create your own gameplay style, set up your strategy before the nightfall. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927780/extras/gameplay2.gif?t=1753263839\" /></div></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First step to the Apocalypse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2927780/b7fbafcf3846b2a0953039e3ad481f5e186cf76c.jpg"},{"name":"Primitive Innovation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2927780/3634c890e391e6567bc577b30378bdb07763a50a.jpg"},{"name":"Laying the Wires","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2927780/a2e45a14ea9c8968852fca78cd8dc04b269cdc9f.jpg"},{"name":"Core Activation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2927780/cd275f16ab8707b32c8a50e5158013cdcb60bb66.jpg"},{"name":"I... Just Drive?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/29